# Let git normalise line endings for new files so Windows/WSL collaborators don't create
# whitespace-only diffs. (Many existing files were committed with CRLF; they are left as-is.
# To convert everything to LF in one dedicated commit: git add --renormalize . with eol=lf set.)
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
